      ],
      "title": "Uncertainty estimation and active learning for molecular force fields",
      "rationale": "All three formulations use uncertainty in machine-learned force fields to guide on-the-fly quantum-mechanical sampling and training-set expansion. Preserve OOD detection, unreliable-configuration triggers and sampling-efficiency motivations."
    },
